2026-07-27T10:16:48.2197216Z i /tmp/RtmpmeA8gN/duckdb
2026-07-27T10:16:48.2197552Z This is removed when the R session ends.
2026-07-27T10:16:48.2197972Z * Extensions are re-downloaded each session.
2026-07-27T10:16:48.2198343Z * Secrets are lost.
2026-07-27T10:16:48.2198885Z i Run duckdb(shared_home = TRUE) (or create ~/.duckdb) to keep them (suitable for most users).
2026-07-27T10:16:48.2199666Z i Run duckdb(shared_home = FALSE) to accept the temporary directory (and silence this message).
2026-07-27T10:16:48.2200735Z i See ?duckdb_storage for details and alternatives.
